\details{
This class preserves the original surface registration implementation used
in early cPME simulations. It evaluates surface and basis functions directly
on the grid at each iteration and does not include the safe backtracking
logic used by the current `Registration` class.
It supports:
- building basis functions
- computing tangent updates
- iterative optimization
- saving state to RDS
}
